# Paste the keys below into your project's .aider.conf.yml.
# These ensure Aider reads the SAD CONVENTIONS.md on every chat.

read:
  - CONVENTIONS.md
  - AGENTS.md
  - .sad/rules/core/README.md

# Optional: also read the constitution on every chat.
# (Trade-off: more context per chat, but stronger SAD discipline.)
# Uncomment if you want maximum persistence:
#  - .sad/memory/constitution.md
